<title>USA: MBIA qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies six issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp on Monday said that it qualified six municipal bond issues, which will be sold competitively, for insurance.</p>
<p>--Miami County, Kan., $2.310 million general obligations.</p>
<p>--Litchfield Community School District, Mich., $3.715 million building bonds.</p>
<p>--Pine City, Minn., Independent School District $2.635 million GOs.</p>
<p>--East Penn School District, Penn., $12.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Paris, Texas, $5 million water and sewer revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Mayville, Wis., $3.105 million GOs.</p>
<p>((--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650)).</p>
